# The repos the nightly backstop runs (#1595): one checkout per line, `~/` is
# the home directory, `#` starts a comment, blank lines are skipped. Adding or
# removing a repo is one line here; bin/backstop-nightly reads this file.
# Optional second field: `<checkout> workflow=<file name>` names the repo's
# full-gate workflow (e.g. `workflow=gate.yml`); the backstop then reads that
# repo's result from CI instead of running its seam locally. No repo below has
# one, so each runs its seam locally.
